<title>MEXICO: Situr 1997 Q1 net profit diminishes.</title>
<headline>Situr 1997 Q1 net profit diminishes.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Net		  362.30 million	     754.14 million</p>
<p>	Revs		 464.19 million	     644.37 million</p>
<p>	Oper Income	59.13 million		158.22 million</p>
<p>	Integ fin gain   347.98 million     gain  550.90 million</p>
<p>	  NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>		Full company name is Grupo Situr SA de CV.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
